From 708795dc8d80aa9124b876450fc17ee8f03d73e8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xkong-anaconda <xkong@anaconda.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 06:20:55 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Update vendored zlib subset from 1.2.11 to 1.4

Replace the vendored zlib files with the madler/zlib v1.4 tag
(https://github.com/madler/zlib/releases/tag/v1.4), byte-for-byte:
zlib.h, zconf.h, zutil.c, zutil.h, gzguts.h and contrib/infback9/*.
zlib >= 1.3.1 drops the classic-MacOS fdopen() macro that breaks the
build with newer Apple SDKs (upstream issues #45, #46).

The 0.2.0 sdist vendors cielavenir/zlib@beaec8d (zlib 1.2.11 plus a
resumable infback9); that change is re-applied by the next patch.

Regenerate: for f in <files>; do git -C zlib show v1.4:$f > zlib/$f; done
